{"id": "21a1f33f-6f84-4fb2-9135-59c4caa19bbf", "slug": "synchronize-orbital-grids", "title": "Synchronize Orbital Grids", "description": "Synchronize Orbital Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Synchronize Orbital Grids\"\ndescription: \"Synchronize Orbital Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#6366F1\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#8B5CF6\"\n  background: \"#02040A\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Synchronize Orbital Grids\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 11; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, effect.\n## Overview\nSynchronize Orbital Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nNEXUS.77 // Online SEC: 99.1021 A / RAD: 11.0042 Z Initialization Sequence Synchronize Orbital Grids. Deploy resilient edge-computing frameworks across decentralized architectures. Aggregate telemetry, scale infrastruct…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Synchronize Orbital Grids..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #6366F1, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #8B5CF6, background #02040A, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Synchronize Orbital Grids</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <!-- GSAP for Masked Text Reveal -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <!-- Three.js for Globe Particles -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Custom utilities */\n        .reveal-mask {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n        .reveal-word {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(120%);\n            opacity: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Tech Grid Background */\n        .tech-grid {\n            background-image:\n                linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),\n                linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);\n            background-size: 48px 48px;\n        }\n\n        /* Ambient Mesh Animations */\n        @keyframes mesh-drift-1 {\n            0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }\n            33% { transform: translate(4%, 8%) scale(1.05); }\n            66% { transform: translate(-4%, 4%) scale(0.95); }\n        }\n        @keyframes mesh-drift-2 {\n            0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }\n            33% { transform: translate(-6%, -4%) scale(0.95); }\n            66% { transform: translate(4%, -6%) scale(1.05); }\n        }\n        @keyframes mesh-drift-3 {\n            0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }\n            50% { transform: translate(-3%, 5%) scale(1.08); }\n        }\n        .animate-mesh-1 { animation: mesh-drift-1 22s ease-in-out infinite; }\n        .animate-mesh-2 { animation: mesh-drift-2 28s ease-in-out infinite reverse; }\n        .animate-mesh-3 { animation: mesh-drift-3 25s ease-in-out infinite; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#02040A] text-slate-200 antialiased font-sans selection:bg-indigo-500/30 overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-8 relative\">\n\n    <!-- Mesh Gradient Atmosphere (Animated) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[-20%] left-[-10%] w-[60vw] h-[60vw] bg-indigo-900/30 rounded-full blur-[120px] animate-mesh-1\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-20%] right-[-10%] w-[50vw] h-[50vw] bg-blue-800/20 rounded-full blur-[100px] animate-mesh-2\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[40%] left-[60%] w-[40vw] h-[40vw] bg-violet-900/15 rounded-full blur-[90px] animate-mesh-3\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Editorial Tech Container (Border Gradient Shell) -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1400px] min-h-[85vh] rounded-3xl p-[1px] shadow-2xl flex flex-col\"\n         style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 100%);\">\n\n        <!-- Inner Shell Fill -->\n        <div class=\"flex-1 rounded-[calc(1.5rem-1px)] bg-[#040814]/90 backdrop-blur-2xl flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative\">\n\n            <!-- Top Infrastructure Navigation / Bar -->\n            <div class=\"h-14 border-b border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between px-6 sm:px-10 shrink-0\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500 animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(99,102,241,0.8)]\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-slate-400 tracking-widest uppercase\">NEXUS.77 // Online</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hidden sm:flex font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 tracking-widest\">\n                    SEC: 99.1021 A / RAD: 11.0042 Z\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Asymmetrical Layout Grid -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col lg:flex-row relative\">\n\n                <!-- Left Column: Editorial Typography -->\n                <div class=\"w-full lg:w-[45%] p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 flex flex-col justify-center border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-white/5 z-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-[#02040A]/40\">\n\n                    <!-- Pre-header Meta -->\n                    <div class=\"mb-10\">\n                        <span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-indigo-400 tracking-widest uppercase border border-indigo-500/20 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/5\">\n                            Initialization Sequence\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Masked Reveal Headline -->\n                    <div class=\"reveal-trigger space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 mb-8\">\n                        <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-[64px] font-normal tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.05]\">\n                            <span class=\"reveal-mask\"><span class=\"reveal-word\">Synchronize</span></span><br/>\n                            <span class=\"reveal-mask\"><span class=\"reveal-word text-indigo-300\">Orbital</span></span><br/>\n                            <span class=\"reveal-mask\"><span class=\"reveal-word\">Grids.</span></span>\n                        </h1>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Supporting Technical Copy -->\n                    <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-400 max-w-md font-light leading-relaxed mb-12\">\n                        Deploy resilient edge-computing frameworks across decentralized architectures. Aggregate telemetry, scale infrastructure, and resolve network topography instantly.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <!-- Restrained CTAs -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4\">\n                        <button class=\"px-6 py-3.5 bg-slate-100 text-[#040814] rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:bg-white transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\">\n                            Initiate Handshake\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" width=\"1.2em\" height=\"1.2em\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- Ghost CTA with precise border gradient -->\n                        <button class=\"px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full text-sm font-normal text-white relative group flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:text-indigo-200 transition-colors\"\n                                style=\"background: linear-gradient(#040814, #040814) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                            Inspect Topology\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Bottom Indicator Strip -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto pt-16 flex items-center gap-8 border-t border-white/5\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase\">Relays</span>\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-slate-300\">8,192</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase\">Ping</span>\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-slate-300\">8ms</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Column: WebGL Globe Canvas -->\n                <div class=\"w-full lg:w-[55%] relative min-h-[50vh] lg:min-h-full flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden tech-grid cursor-crosshair\">\n\n                    <!-- Gradient Falloff Masking -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at center, transparent 30%, #040814 100%);\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- 3D Scene Target -->\n                    <div id=\"globe-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 mix-blend-plus-lighter\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Floating Node Callouts -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[25%] right-[20%] flex items-center gap-3 z-20 pointer-events-none\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(99,102,241,0.8)]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-indigo-200\">NEXUS-01</span>\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-500\">SYNCED</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-[30%] left-[20%] flex items-center gap-3 z-20 pointer-events-none\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(139,92,246,0.8)]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-violet-200\">RELAY-9B</span>\n                            <span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-500\">ROUTING</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Initialization Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            // 1. GSAP Masked Reveal\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n            gsap.to('.reveal-word', {\n                y: '0%',\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: 'power4.out',\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: '.reveal-trigger',\n                    start: 'top 90%',\n                }\n            });\n\n            // 2. Three.js Globe Particles\n            const container = document.getElementById('globe-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            // Atmospheric fog blending into background\n            scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x040814, 0.018);\n\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 55;\n            camera.position.y = 10; // Slight tilt to expose planetary rings\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Shader points for crisp luminous look\n            const coreMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.18,\n                color: 0xf8fafc,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.7,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending,\n                depthWrite: false\n            });\n\n            const ringMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.15,\n                color: 0x6366f1, // Shifted to Indigo\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.5,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending,\n                depthWrite: false\n            });\n\n            // Core spherical particle cluster\n            const coreGeo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const coreCount = 4000;\n            const corePos = new Float32Array(coreCount * 3);\n            for(let i=0; i<coreCount*3; i+=3) {\n                const r = 12 * Math.cbrt(Math.random());\n                const theta = Math.random() * 2 * Math.PI;\n                const phi = Math.acos(2 * Math.random() - 1);\n                corePos[i] = r * Math.sin(phi) * Math.cos(theta);\n                corePos[i+1] = r * Math.sin(phi) * Math.sin(theta);\n                corePos[i+2] = r * Math.cos(phi);\n            }\n            coreGeo.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(corePos, 3));\n            const globeCore = new THREE.Points(coreGeo, coreMaterial);\n\n            // Outer wider orbital ring/disc\n            const ringGeo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const ringCount = 8000;\n            const ringPos = new Float32Array(ringCount * 3);\n            for(let i=0; i<ringCount*3; i+=3) {\n                const r = 14 + Math.random() * 12; // Radius range 14-26\n                const theta = Math.random() * 2 * Math.PI;\n                const y = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 1.5; // Flattened disc structure\n                ringPos[i] = r * Math.cos(theta);\n                ringPos[i+1] = y;\n                ringPos[i+2] = r * Math.sin(theta);\n            }\n            ringGeo.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(ringPos, 3));\n            const orbitalRing = new THREE.Points(ringGeo, ringMaterial);\n\n            // Structural group for tilt\n            const globeGroup = new THREE.Group();\n            globeGroup.add(globeCore);\n            globeGroup.add(orbitalRing);\n\n            // Apply planetary tilt\n            globeGroup.rotation.x = Math.PI * 0.15;\n            globeGroup.rotation.z = Math.PI * 0.05;\n            scene.add(globeGroup);\n\n            // Subtle mouse drift\n            let targetX = 0;\n            let targetY = 0;\n            const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n            const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                targetX = (e.clientX - windowHalfX) * 0.0005;\n                targetY = (e.clientY - windowHalfY) * 0.0005;\n            });\n\n            // Responsive resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            });\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const delta = clock.getDelta();\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Idle continuous rotation\n                globeCore.rotation.y += 0.05 * delta;\n                orbitalRing.rotation.y -= 0.03 * delta;\n\n                // Gentle breathing scale\n                const scale = 1 + Math.sin(elapsedTime * 0.5) * 0.015;\n                globeGroup.scale.set(scale, scale, scale);\n\n                // Mouse drift interpolation\n                globeGroup.rotation.y += (targetX - globeGroup.rotation.y) * 0.05;\n                globeGroup.rotation.x += (targetY - globeGroup.rotation.x + Math.PI * 0.15) * 0.05;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n            animate();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "synchronize-orbital-grids.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/synchronize-orbital-grids.jpg", "source_name": "synchronize-orbital-grids-DESIGN.md", "views": 41, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T03:49:37.141376+00:00"}